story-052 L59 and story-103 checklist L199 say: 'The owner already holds 202.30 BPT ... phStaging2 will transfer it owner -> escrow' and 'compute minAmountsOut over the escrow's COMBINED BPT balance'. On-chain this is false. The 202.30039704702753 BPT reached OWNER_EOA from the old pooler at block 25,985,116, and at block 25,985,119 (tx 0xd8ecb3be133b0262ab5fc27a221c5007268b40c7017363a216fee9ae6c5cc082) it was sent to 0xf719d6d9cd90836506a4845969ecd753d6d963b9 and burned in the same tx. BPT supply now equals exactly old pooler + EOA 0xc65f, and OWNER_EOA holds 0 at the fork block and at head. Consequences, none of which lose value:
- floors sized on 20,604.1 BPT exceed the true share by 0.99%, so exitAndSeed reverts at any tolerance below 0.99%;
- a hardcoded transfer(escrow, 202.30e18) reverts;
- a live-read transfer of 0 is a no-op.
All fail loud before wiring.
